  "description": "Read, write, edit and calculate Excel .xlsx files: typed lists through a source generator, streaming rows, and a document model with a formula engine. Styles, charts, pictures and SVG, shapes, conditional formatting, pivot tables and slicers, and a check for macros and links in files from outside. Failures come back as Avig.Result values. No dependencies besides Avig.Result and Avig.OpenXml; trimming and Native AOT safe.",
